data: {"id": "0befade1833540d7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1276", "run_id": "0befade1833540d7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n  - Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload`（UID `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`）当前 Kubernetes 相位为 **Running**，但容器 **app** 处于 **Waiting: CrashLoopBackOff**，`Ready=False`。\n  - 重启次数 **19**；`restartPolicy=Always`。\n  - 容器 image：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`；资源限制：cpu 50m / memory 32Mi。\n\n- **终止原因与退出码**\n  - `Last State: Terminated`，`Reason=Error`，**Exit Code 78**，启动与结束仅差约 1 秒（16:32:02 → 16:32:03）。\n  - Exit Code 78 为应用程序自定义退出码，**不是 OOMKilled（137）**，也未出现 K", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789144400668, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

