data: {"id": "0befade1833540d7-final", "run_id": "0befade1833540d7", "seq": 1281, "ts_ms": 1789144414356, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | 容器应用主进程缺少必需的环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG 导致启动即退出（Exit Code 78） |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v10(d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6)` | 证实容器因启动失败被反复重启 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | `last_terminated_reason: Error` (Exit Code: 78) | 确认主进程异常退出并返回非零状态码 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` | 直接定位到应用层缺少特定配置变量导致崩溃 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 19` | 从监控系统独立印证了 19 次重启的事实 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubelet | `pod.phase: Running` (但 `ContainersReady: False`) | 表明 Pod 存活但业务容器未就绪，状态与预期不符 |\n\nK8s 层面的重启计数（#1, #2, #4）与日志中记录的退出原因（#3）完全一致，且由不同监控系统独立采集，排除了单一数据源偏差。日志中具体的缺失变量名提供了决定性的故障根因，解释了为何容器会频繁退出。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG 缺失 → 应用主进程启动即报错退出 (Exit Code 78) → K8s 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 机制并反复重启 → 用户可见容器反复重启且无法就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：应用主进程在启动过程中因缺少必需的 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量而立即退出（Exit Code 78）。该事实由 `elasticsearch` 日志（#3）直接捕获，并由 `kubelet` 的崩溃重启事件（#1, #2）和 `prometheus` 重启指标（#4）交叉验证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 534.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 534.1s (Evidence 527.8s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 554.67, "metrics": {"run_id": "0befade1833540d7", "mttr": {"value": "9.2m", "seconds": 554.6766657829285, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 554676.6657829285, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 551794.1777706146, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7277.971982955933, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2525.949478149414}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13270.430326461792, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 534136.3384723663, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7250.266075134277, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

